    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_what_title">What is Pixistory?</string>
    <string name="about_what_body">Pixistory is a home for the devices you collect. Keep each device with its software version, security patch, receipts and history, and learn the story behind every Pixel.</string>
    <string name="about_features_title">Features</string>
    <string name="about_features_body">• Device collection with photos, tags, barcodes and receipts\n• Pixel history, tech specs, new features and known faults\n• Pixel Drops from 2024 with exact device compatibility\n• Android coverage and collection analysis\n• Sign in with Google and cloud sync\n• Ask Pixi, an AI assistant for your collection\n• Optimised for Pixel Fold: two panes and tabletop shelf mode\n• English and Urdu</string>
    <string name="about_data_title">About the Pixel data</string>
    <string name="about_data_body">Specs, Pixel Drop history, compatibility and fault notes are compiled from Google announcements and press and community reports. They can be incomplete or out of date, so check Google\'s official pages before you rely on them.</string>
